WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.780 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  Angelina Jolie candidly addresses her  split from Brad Pitt the stunning  actress covers the September issue of  Vanity Fair her interview is open honest  candid and very vulnerable she tells the  mag of her divorce from Brad quote it's  just been the hardest time and were just  kind of coming up for air we're all  trying to do our best to heal our family  the former couple's decision to call it  quits shocked the world they had been  together more than ten years and things  turned ugly fast courts got involved and  rumors swirled still Angelina says she  and Brad are now on the same page quote  we care for each other and care about  our family and we are both working  towards the same goal it's clear that  their six children are the main focus  since the split Angelina says she's  worked hard to be a really good  homemaker she picks up dog poop clean  dishes and reads bedtime stories  she explained quote I was very worried  about my mother growing up a lot I do  not want my children to be worried about  me Angelina even bravely admitted she  cries in the shower not in front of the  kids  quote do they need to know that  everything's going to be all right even  when you're not sure it is up next for  the actress the release of first they  killed my father  the thriller she co-produced with her  son Maddox and also positive Angelina  revealed she and her estranged father  Jon Voight have reconciled  [Music]

